ok    Bundled runtime       msb 0.7.7-puddle.2 (C:\Users\dev\AppData\Local\Programs\puddle\runtime\msb.exe)
FAIL  Runtime starts        App Control for Business (WDAC) or Smart App Control blocks msb
      fix:  A code integrity policy doesn't allow
            C:\Users\dev\AppData\Local\Programs\puddle\runtime\msb.exe. Allow Puddle's files or
            signer in that policy; Event Viewer > Applications and Services Logs > Microsoft >
            Windows > CodeIntegrity > Operational names the rule. Smart App Control has no
            exceptions: it can only be turned off (Windows Security > App & browser control >
            Smart App Control).
